# Gate step 2031-z4rm — data, not code (order 1072-b7eq).
#
# Every Lua door child gets the runner's TILLANDSIAS_* variables minus the
# credential-shaped ones (2031-h5ru; design 2029-39bt §4.10). That is safe only
# while a name spelled like a credential IS one: a non-secret spelled like one
# is silently dropped from children (TILLANDSIAS_WRAPPER_TOKEN, the reaper's
# marker, was), and a secret spelled otherwise leaks. The fixture runs the
# guard scripts/lua/check-env-namespace-hygiene.lua on this tree, then on
# scratch trees with a planted credential-shaped name (refused), a locator name
# (passes) and no code (could-not-run).
#
# STEP_LUA is a LITERAL path on purpose (1063-nraf).
STEP_DESC="Checking TILLANDSIAS_ names are spelled like credentials only when they are (2031-z4rm)"
